This skill is an academic-writing adaptation inspired by Humanize KR:
https://github.com/epoko77-ai/im-not-ai

The original project is licensed under the MIT License. This adaptation keeps
the original fidelity-first idea but replaces detector-oriented and general
prose rules with safeguards for citations, quantitative results, disciplinary
terminology, epistemic modality, causal claims, and manuscript section roles.
